title: pidly list / tree / check
desc:18
Read-only views. list defaults to takeable work — unclaimed and unblocked —
which it can determine from the first two lines of each ticket plus a
number-to-path map, without reading a single body. tree renders the hierarchy
with open and closed children distinguished.

Build the map with one traversal. Searching per dependency is quadratic and
measurably so: 26.5s against 2.0s on a 2003-ticket tree.

check validates every ticket against schema.md, confirms desc: points at the
real last line of the body, resolves every needs entry to a real ticket,
detects cycles in the needs graph, reports claims and locks whose holder is
dead, reports an AGENTS.md block that no longer matches the current one, and
confirms no number appears twice. It never modifies anything and exits
nonzero on problems, so it can run in CI.
effort: L
